OL,3,GNEWSAReform's Joe Martin given Senedd
OL,4,Aspeaking ban after he said white people
OL,5,Aare being replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Reform MS has been banned from
OL,8,Fspeaking in the Senedd until he
OL,9,Fapologises for claiming white people
OL,10,Fwere being replaced in the UK.
OL,12,FPresiding Officer Huw Irranca-Davies
OL,13,Fsaid Joe Martin's comments were clearly
OL,14,F"discriminatory" and "offensive".
OL,16,FOn Tuesday Martin asked the Welsh
OL,17,Fgovernment for a statement on the
OL,18,F"demographic replacement of white
OL,19,FBritish people".
OL,21,FReform was asked for comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
